# Veltrix

A lightweight API health monitoring tool built with Python.

## Features

- Monitor multiple API endpoints
- Measure response latency
- Detect unavailable services
- Identify degraded HTTP responses
- Simple JSON configuration
- Zero database dependency

## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/veltrix.git
cd veltrix
pip install -r requirements.txt
{
  "timeout": 5,
  "services": [
    {
      "name": "My API",
      "url": "https://api.example.com/health"
    }
  ]
}
python monitor.py
